//! The `border-collapse` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property sets
//! whether cells inside a `table` have shared or separate borders.
//!
//! Initial: separate. Inherited: yes.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Keyword effects:
//! - collapse: Adjacent cells have shared borders (the collapsed-border table rendering model).
//! - separate: Adjacent cells have distinct borders (the separated-border table rendering model).
//!
//! Grammar: separate | collapse
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-tables-3/#propdef-border-collapse
//!
//! Author guide:
